      "created_at": "2013-02-18T20:23:08.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>The playtesters don't have any problem saying what works and what doesn't. By SotM, people started playtesting buy RC. By that time the core mechanics were worked out and you only had to fit something new into the system. This time, everything is being commented on, even some of the core mechanics.</p>",
